  fallbackReactions:
  - category: 40
    calmPassenger: Looks like rain. Take your time.
    chaosPassenger: Rain makes the city look like a movie.
  - category: 41
    calmPassenger: That thunder is a good reason to drive carefully.
    chaosPassenger: The sky brought its own sound effects.
  - category: 42
    calmPassenger: I can barely see the next block.
    chaosPassenger: Mysterious. I approve of the atmosphere.
  - category: 43
    calmPassenger: The city gets quieter after dark.
    chaosPassenger: Night shift. Now the interesting people come out.
  - category: 44
    calmPassenger: Look at that sunset.
    chaosPassenger: Even this city knows how to make an entrance.
  - category: 46
    calmPassenger: We can stop at a restroom. Really.
    chaosPassenger: This ride has developed an unexpected side quest.
  - category: 47
    calmPassenger: Please tell me we are stopping first.
    chaosPassenger: That is certainly one way to manage a schedule.
  - category: 48
    calmPassenger: I would still prefer a restroom next time.
    chaosPassenger: Flawless technique. A very unusual talent.
  - category: 49
    calmPassenger: We need a cleanup stop. Immediately.
    chaosPassenger: Well. That story is going in the review.
  - category: 50
    calmPassenger: Much better. Ready when you are.
    chaosPassenger: Pit stop complete. Back to the adventure.
